  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He appears as a little boy with black hair, a cowlick, and a round cute face that resembles a peach, yet his aura is overwhelming. After a missed killer move he giggles and asks whether Dong Fang Yu knows the power of Vortex Space Boy. Dong Fang Yu calls him a disgusting old man pretending to be young while half a step into his coffin. His smile fades and he charges again.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has the appearance of a child with black hair, a small cowlick on top of his head, and a round cute face.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Central Continent immortals charging Eastern Sea, narration names Vortex Space Boy as one who cultivates space path and has terrifying killer moves, listing him with other famous Heavenly Court experts in history.",
      "chapters": [
        1924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "space-path-expert",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He teleports toward the phantom River of Time. A huge vortex with immense suction appears above him. The phantom River of Time stays unmoved, but the newly arrived Nian Er Nong Fu is sucked in at once. Vortex Space Boy laughs, exerts more force, and tries to grind and crush him while Nian Er Nong Fu resists inside a pale yellow halo.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He screams as he carries the head of a Southern Border Gu Immortal, then chuckles that Zhou Xiong Xin and the others are moving too slowly. Wu Yong chases him. Their prepared immortal killer moves collide, both grunt, and both faces turn pale.",
      "chapters": [
        1929
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Zhao Shan He prepares sitting and eating the mountain empty again, Ye Qiao Zi and Vortex Space Boy stop Wu Yong and Yi Hao Fang from charging in.",
      "chapters": [
        1931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_shan_he",
        "char_ye_qiao_zi",
        "char_yi_hao_fang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court answers offense with offense. Vortex Space Boy and Jun Shen Guang move ahead toward the five regional limit formation while others form the middle group.",
      "chapters": [
        1937
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jun_shen_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Jun Shen Guang he charges the front again. Narration states one cultivates light path and the other space path, and that their killer move activation is fastest. Dragon Palace uses Dreamy Light Smoke and carries both away. After capturing them, Dragon Palace reaches its capture limit unless those two are killed.",
      "chapters": [
        1942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "move_dreamy_light_smoke"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Shuai releases the suppressed Jun Shen Guang and Vortex Space Boy from Dragon Palace so the house can activate Dreamy Light Smoke again against Duke Long.",
      "chapters": [
        1948
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He attacks together with Ye Qiao Zi as Heavenly Court presses Calamity Luck Altar, Dragon Palace, and other Immortal Gu Houses.",
      "chapters": [
        1953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He screams as he appears behind Fang Yuan. Fang Yuan grabs his tiny head and clenches it into a fist, forcibly turning the head into a mush of blood and brain matter.",
      "chapters": [
        1959
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
